asr-000934
00:33:35.320 --> 00:33:48.100
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Aviation, we proposed 42 projects, totaling to 23 billion, but we were only given allocation for 10 projects, amounting to 5.8 billion.

asr-000935
