asr-000937
00:33:57.640 --> 00:34:08.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ma'am, may problema po tayo. Ito po yung isang problema. You've been talking about aviation. Kasama po ba dyan yung mga airports po natin? Is that what we're talking about?

asr-000938
00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:12.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes, sir. Improvement po of our airports nationwide.

asr-000939
00:34:12.440 --> 00:34:19.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: We have a problem. We're facing a big problem. Yung mga tourist destinations po natin, bumaba lahat because of the fact.

asr-000940
00:34:20.620 --> 00:34:30.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So ng mga turboprop na airplanes natin, they cannot land and take off sa Naia. So ang option po is sa Clark.

asr-000941
00:34:31.160 --> 00:34:44.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung ako po ang turista, tiga Manila, hindi po ako pupunta ng Clark para sumakay, para pupunta ng Boracay or pupunta ng Busuanga. Marami po tayo mga islands within na ikang turboprop ang ginagamit.

asr-000942
00:34:44.100 --> 00:34:50.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero because of the travel time po eh, from Manila to. My question now is, well, di ba po?

asr-000943
00:34:50.620 --> 00:34:56.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Di ba may pinagpag-uusap before na we're going to do something, we're going to develop it pong Sangli?

asr-000944
00:34:57.160 --> 00:35:06.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Well, whatever happened to Sangli po, parang wala na nangyayari ho dyan. Can we develop Sangli para doon na lang mag-take off landing yung mga turboprop?

asr-000945
00:35:06.540 --> 00:35:13.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Madali na lang po, mas malapit-lapit. Siguro, barge na lang po galing po sa Cavite, papunta po, tatawid na lang po yun. Mas malapit.

asr-000946
00:35:13.220 --> 00:35:19.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaysa sa pupunta pa ng Clark, takes about one hour to two hours ang biyahe po going to Clark.

asr-000947
00:35:20.620 --> 00:35:22.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano dyan sa Sangli?

asr-000948
00:35:23.040 --> 00:35:27.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair, Your Honor. May dalawa pong aspeto itong Sangli natin.

asr-000949
00:35:27.820 --> 00:35:33.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung Sangli na airport na sinasabi natin, domestic airport, yan po ay nasa DOTR at sa Kakaab.

asr-000950
00:35:34.340 --> 00:35:41.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero yung sinasabi po natin na mas malaking Sangli International Airport, yan po ay isang JV with the Provincial Government of Cavite.

asr-000951
00:35:41.820 --> 00:35:45.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Well, hindi ho sa National Government.

asr-000952
00:35:45.560 --> 00:35:50.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun pa man, ang DOTR at ang Kakaab ay nakipagtulungan po.

asr-000953
00:35:50.620 --> 00:36:04.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Doon sa probinsya ng Cavite, kasama na po yung mga proponent ng ating Sangli International Airport, pagdating sa mga technical po na gawain sa aviation, tayo po sa DOTR at Kakaab.

asr-000954
00:36:04.400 --> 00:36:12.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero ito po ay isang malaking proyekto po. Ang kasama din po dito ay pagkikipag-ugnayan, pagkikipag-usap sa Philippine Navy po natin.

asr-000955
00:36:12.620 --> 00:36:18.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung Sangli po natin ay hindi lang po DOTR itself, nandyan pa po yung Philippine Navy natin.

asr-000956
00:36:18.660 --> 00:36:20.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I may say, Mr. Chairman,

asr-000957
00:36:20.620 --> 00:36:36.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Just last, over the weekend po, isa po yan sa mga pinag-usapan po ng ating Pangulo also, doon po sa state visit po natin sa India, kasama po ang GMR, kasama din po yung proponent po ng ating Sangli International Airport.

asr-000958
00:36:36.680 --> 00:36:45.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So madaling sabi po, Mr. Chairman, tuloy naman po ang proyekto, kasama ang Provincial Government of Cavite, at ang DOTR at Kakaab ay nakipagtulungan po sa kanila.

asr-000959
00:36:45.960 --> 00:36:50.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi po, Secretary, Mr. Chair, the problem po,

asr-000960
00:36:50.620 --> 00:36:53.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: bumaba po talaga lahat ng tourist destinations.

asr-000961
00:36:53.380 --> 00:36:56.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I went around the country po these past few months.

asr-000962
00:36:56.600 --> 00:37:01.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Lahat po nagreklamo. There was a drop in their ikanga tourist arrivals.

asr-000963
00:37:01.560 --> 00:37:08.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And when you ask naman po mga travel agencies, ang sagot po sa atin, kasi sir, pupunta pa sila ng Clark eh, bibiyahe pa.

asr-000964
00:37:08.700 --> 00:37:12.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi kagaya dito, mga tiga Quezon City, Pasay, Barikina, etc.

asr-000965
00:37:13.060 --> 00:37:14.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tiga NCR,

asr-000966
00:37:15.160 --> 00:37:18.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nandiretso na na po sa naiya, pero siyempre nag-e-expand po tayo.

asr-000967
00:37:18.860 --> 00:37:20.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At ang ginawa naman po ng,

asr-000968
00:37:20.620 --> 00:37:22.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: company po ni nang naiya ngayon,

asr-000969
00:37:22.860 --> 00:37:24.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nung privatized po yan,

asr-000970
00:37:24.860 --> 00:37:25.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: magpapatakbo yan,

asr-000971
00:37:26.080 --> 00:37:27.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: para ma-de-congest.

asr-000972
00:37:27.400 --> 00:37:29.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maganda naman po, I mean, yung intention.

asr-000973
00:37:29.600 --> 00:37:30.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alisin po yung mga turboprop.

asr-000974
00:37:31.100 --> 00:37:32.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero nga lang po,

asr-000975
00:37:32.440 --> 00:37:35.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nag-suffer naman po yung tourist arrivals natin

asr-000976
00:37:35.240 --> 00:37:36.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa iba't-ibang mga major.

asr-000977
00:37:37.180 --> 00:37:38.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nakakaya po ako, I'm from Palawan,

asr-000978
00:37:39.380 --> 00:37:42.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: bumaba po yung ikanga arrivals po sa El Nido,

asr-000979
00:37:42.900 --> 00:37:44.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa Coron, sa Busuanga,

asr-000980
00:37:44.960 --> 00:37:46.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: dahil nga po, tapos may mga burakay din.

asr-000981
00:37:46.820 --> 00:37:48.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or even dito po sa Batanes,

asr-000982
00:37:49.640 --> 00:37:50.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: bumaba po.

asr-000983
00:37:50.620 --> 00:37:52.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Layo pa po, bibiyahin eh.

asr-000984
00:37:52.500 --> 00:37:53.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Can we do something na,

asr-000985
00:37:54.240 --> 00:37:56.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ikanga mapabilis, mapapastruck,

asr-000986
00:37:56.200 --> 00:37:58.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na ilipat na lang natin ang turboprop

asr-000987
00:37:58.220 --> 00:37:59.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ng mga airplanes,

asr-000988
00:37:59.700 --> 00:38:01.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: diyan po mag-landing and take-off

asr-000989
00:38:01.340 --> 00:38:05.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa ikanga airport na yan?

asr-000990
00:38:05.880 --> 00:38:07.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, Mr. Chairman, Your Honor.

asr-000991
00:38:07.680 --> 00:38:10.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po, ang pulisiya po natin ngayon sa DOTR,

asr-000992
00:38:11.260 --> 00:38:13.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay itong pagpapahaba ng runway po.

asr-000993
00:38:14.040 --> 00:38:15.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailangan natin gawin yan,

asr-000994
00:38:15.380 --> 00:38:16.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung pagpapahaba ng runway.

asr-000995
00:38:16.680 --> 00:38:18.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Itong mga turboprop po kasi,

asr-000996
00:38:18.940 --> 00:38:20.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na sinasabi natin,

asr-000997
00:38:20.100 --> 00:38:22.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: iyan lang po yung pipwede sa mga malilit na runway.

asr-000998
00:38:23.200 --> 00:38:25.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And usually, ito yung mga tourist spot natin.

asr-000999
00:38:26.120 --> 00:38:28.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At bagamat tumingi kami ng pondo,

asr-001000
00:38:29.340 --> 00:38:30.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para kahit papaano,

asr-001001
00:38:30.660 --> 00:38:31.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yun yung unahin natin,

asr-001002
00:38:32.280 --> 00:38:35.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pagpapahaba at pagpapalapad ng ating mga runway,

asr-001003
00:38:35.900 --> 00:38:39.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: hindi po tayo nabigyan ng sapat na pondo sa NEP natin.

asr-001004
00:38:39.400 --> 00:38:41.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, nakikiusap tayo sa KAAP,

asr-001005
00:38:41.800 --> 00:38:43.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na pondohan na po nila yung mga runway.

asr-001006
00:38:44.180 --> 00:38:47.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We identified two, Mr. Chairman, if I may say.

asr-001007
00:38:47.600 --> 00:38:49.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Itong sa ating Busuanga po,

asr-001008
00:38:50.100 --> 00:38:54.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: dire-diretso na po yung pagpapalapad at pagpapahaba po ng ating runway dyan.

asr-001009
00:38:54.800 --> 00:38:58.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hopefully, we can finish it by second quarter of next year.

asr-001010
00:38:58.200 --> 00:38:59.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Upang sa ganon,

asr-001011
00:38:59.140 --> 00:39:01.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung mga babiyahe pong turista,

asr-001012
00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:05.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: makagamit na nila yung bigger plane, yung mga jet engine plane natin,

asr-001013
00:39:05.360 --> 00:39:07.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at dito na po sa Manila yan.

asr-001014
00:39:07.220 --> 00:39:09.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hindi na kailangan sa Clark.

asr-001015
00:39:09.220 --> 00:39:12.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, yun pa rin po ang magiging kailangan maging rason.

asr-001016
00:39:12.020 --> 00:39:14.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At yun dapat ang tamang pulisiya,

asr-001017
00:39:14.260 --> 00:39:16.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na pahabaan yung mga runway.

asr-001018
00:39:16.260 --> 00:39:19.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hindi lang po na makakabawas kasi po yan,

asr-001019
00:39:19.920 --> 00:39:23.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa pamasahe din po ng ating mga turista at sa mga mananakay.

asr-001020
00:39:23.580 --> 00:39:27.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mas mabilis po ba ang gawin yung pagpapahaba ng runway?

asr-001021
00:39:27.180 --> 00:39:31.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: O paglilipat nila ng takeoff at gagawing airport ng domestic flights

asr-001022
00:39:31.860 --> 00:39:33.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ng mga DLAC na aeroplano,

asr-001023
00:39:33.860 --> 00:39:37.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ang paglilipat po dyan sa Sangli rather than pagpapahaba?

asr-001024
00:39:37.660 --> 00:39:41.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po mas mabilis na ikaw nga maisakatuparan?

asr-001025
00:39:42.160 --> 00:39:44.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sitwasyon kasi po natin sa Sangli ngayon,

asr-001026
00:39:44.860 --> 00:39:48.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think we just have limitado po yung espasyo sa Sangli.

asr-001027
00:39:48.760 --> 00:39:49.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think we just have

asr-001029
00:39:49.860 --> 00:39:51.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: two hangars there, or three hangars.

asr-001030
00:39:51.860 --> 00:39:53.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung mga ibang hangers pa dyan,

asr-001031
00:39:53.360 --> 00:39:59.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ginagamit pa ng mga helicopter o yata, match upper.

asr-001032
00:39:59.360 --> 00:40:03.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ginagamit ang Sangli dun sa ating mga sinasabing fissure fork.

asr-001033
00:40:03.860 --> 00:40:07.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung ginagamit nilang pang negosyo.

asr-001034
00:40:07.360 --> 00:40:10.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May mga iba't iba din po na ginagamit ng mga aviation po,

asr-001035
00:40:10.860 --> 00:40:14.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Gen-AV natin, turbo prop, dito sa Sangli.

asr-001036
00:40:14.520 --> 00:40:18.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero hindi po sapat yung espasyo para sa Sangli.

asr-001037
00:40:18.100 --> 00:40:19.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And another reason po,

asr-001038
00:40:19.700 --> 00:40:21.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kung bakit nahihirapan din po tayo, Sangli,

asr-001039
00:40:21.980 --> 00:40:24.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung access po papunta sa airport.

asr-001040
00:40:24.760 --> 00:40:27.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailangan to'y gumawa ng mas magandang access road

asr-001041
00:40:27.460 --> 00:40:28.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: papuntang airport,

asr-001042
00:40:28.840 --> 00:40:30.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kung hindi ho ang dadaanan natin

asr-001043
00:40:30.360 --> 00:40:32.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: mga maliliit na syudad,

asr-001044
00:40:32.140 --> 00:40:33.720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: maliliit na kalsada,

asr-001045
00:40:34.020 --> 00:40:35.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at napakahirap po dahil sa traffic.

asr-001046
00:40:36.920 --> 00:40:38.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Probably later on,

asr-001047
