Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'd just like to ask

asr-001051
00:40:47.200 --> 00:40:49.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: how long is the presentation later?

asr-001052
00:40:49.860 --> 00:40:51.560
