01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:05.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chairman, Your Honors, thank you for your patience. We're ready to answer some questions.

asr-001519
01:00:05.780 --> 01:00:17.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you. Secretary Lopez, before the Chair will propound questions, I'll ask my colleagues first. Our Senate President?

asr-001520
01:00:17.840 --> 01:00:20.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll defer to Senator Erwin.

asr-001521
01:00:20.840 --> 01:00:28.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Erwin, according to arrival, so Senator Tulfo, you may now ask questions.

asr-001522
01:00:28.240 --> 01:00:50.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: All right, thank you, Mr. Chair. Secretary Lopez, sir, napansin ko po, pinag-uusapan nga namin ni Siguro Sapanho ito sa KAAP, but do we have plans to ikang lagyan ng mga tubes yung Puerto Princesa City Airport?

asr-001523
01:00:50.960 --> 01:00:56.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Taga doon po ako eh. I mean, naglagay po tayo ng airport and tinawag po nating international.

asr-001524
01:00:56.780 --> 01:01:08.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pag umambon lang po, eh hindi na makababa ang pasahero o may payong kaagad. Pag umaraw, payong. I was wondering, sino ang nagdasinong kula po ang nagdesign ng airport na yun?

asr-001525
01:01:09.320 --> 01:01:20.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At mga turista, nagagalit nga po eh. Gusto po pumunta ng El Nido, gusto po pumunta doon sa mga beaches sa Puerto Princesa, wala hong tube. Hindi ko maintindihan. Bakit po ganun?

asr-001526
01:01:20.960 --> 01:01:26.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you po, Mr. Chair. Your Honor, tama po kayo. At maalala ko pa po, tumawag po kayo kung bakit wala pong tube.

asr-001527
01:01:26.780 --> 01:01:53.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung ating Puerto Princesa. The Puerto Princesa Airport was ano po yan? Korea-funded project po yan. Keksim Bank po yan. But when you raise that concern po, Mr. Chairman, Your Honor, magiging pulisiya na po ng DOTR kasama ang KAAP na simula ngayon lahat ng ating malalaking airport at kung ito naman ay pwede maging international airport,

asr-001528
01:01:53.160 --> 01:01:56.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the design itself right from the start.

asr-001529
01:01:56.780 --> 01:01:59.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Merong provision for passenger boarding bridge.

asr-001530
01:02:00.400 --> 01:02:07.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po ang ginagawa namin sa mga, sabi natin, mga malilit na airport natin, mga iba't ibang airport sa probinsya,

asr-001531
01:02:07.820 --> 01:02:11.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: nagpapagawa kami nitong, kasi nga, papag mas talagang matatanda, mainit, mulan,

asr-001532
01:02:11.880 --> 01:02:17.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang layo ho eh, ang nilalakad nila mula sa terminal, papunta kung saan yung aeroplano natin.

asr-001533
01:02:17.800 --> 01:02:23.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Isa po sa mga inisiyatibong pinapairal natin ngayon ay yung sinasabi nating,

asr-001534
01:02:26.780 --> 01:02:35.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Air Stairs, maybe I can defer to KAAP, pero gagawin po namin yan sa policy na po mula ngayon.

asr-001535
01:02:35.300 --> 01:02:41.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: But, Sec. Lopez, before you refer to KAAP, Puerto Princesa is international airport, correct?

asr-001536
01:02:42.200 --> 01:02:42.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po.

asr-001537
01:02:43.280 --> 01:02:49.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero the design po was through, keksimbang po yan, we just said that time.

asr-001538
01:02:49.400 --> 01:02:53.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maybe what we can do right now, Mr. Chairman, I'm finding ways out.

asr-001539
01:02:53.560 --> 01:02:56.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Secretary, I was wondering, sila po yan.

asr-001540
01:02:56.360 --> 01:03:02.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero wala ba tayong pakialam sa design na common sense, we'll say like,

asr-001541
01:03:02.960 --> 01:03:07.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: lagyan natin, may mga senior citizens, tama po kayo eh, malayo po eh, dito pa pa parada.

asr-001542
01:03:07.920 --> 01:03:15.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Binilang ko po parang, from pagbaba mo ng aeroplano hanggang doon sa arrival lounge ng Puerto Princesa eh,

asr-001543
01:03:15.980 --> 01:03:18.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: parang nakaka 2,000 steps ka na eh.

asr-001544
01:03:18.520 --> 01:03:21.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kunti nilang lalakarin mo, parang may 10,000 steps ka na.

asr-001545
01:03:21.860 --> 01:03:24.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So hindi ko alam bakit inaprubahan po yan.

asr-001546
01:03:24.380 --> 01:03:26.280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Well, alam ko po, hindi pa hunin yung panahon.

asr-001547
01:03:26.360 --> 01:03:31.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero dapat siguro next time, tama po kayo, yung policy na natin ngayon,

asr-001548
01:03:31.140 --> 01:03:32.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na pag malalaking airport, dapat po eh.

asr-001549
01:03:34.280 --> 01:03:36.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So anong planong gawin dyan?

asr-001550
01:03:37.360 --> 01:03:40.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: General Rosario, sir, what are we going to do?

asr-001551
01:03:40.240 --> 01:03:42.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi na natin lalagyan ng tube yan? Ganun na lang yun?

asr-001552
01:03:44.960 --> 01:03:46.880
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Pinag-aaralan po natin kung pwede pa.

asr-001553
01:03:46.880 --> 01:03:53.880
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Pero magiging malaking trabaho po dahil may structural implications.

asr-001554
01:03:54.480 --> 01:03:56.280
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Sa ngayon, yung sinabi po ni Secretary,

asr-001555
01:03:56.360 --> 01:03:58.320
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: ay nalagyan muna ng air stairs,

asr-001556
01:03:58.760 --> 01:04:01.420
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: which is nakaprogram na po for procurement.

asr-001557
01:04:01.680 --> 01:04:04.620
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Dalawa ang naka-allocate for Puerto Princesa

asr-001558
01:04:04.620 --> 01:04:09.580
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: at gayon din po sa ibang airport for convenience po ng mga pasayero.

asr-001559
01:04:10.720 --> 01:04:12.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So air stairs lang po lalagyan natin.

asr-001560
01:04:13.000 --> 01:04:14.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So paano pag umulan o wala rin?

asr-001561
01:04:14.880 --> 01:04:16.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or umambon?

asr-001562
01:04:16.840 --> 01:04:20.200
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Yung design po ng air stairs natin ay may cover.

asr-001563
01:04:20.600 --> 01:04:21.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, okay.

asr-001564
01:04:21.160 --> 01:04:23.040
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Pagka dating sa babae, ganun po.

asr-001565
01:04:23.200 --> 01:04:26.320
CAAP Director General Raul L. Del Rosario: Talagang papayungan ng mga airline.

asr-001566
01:04:26.880 --> 01:04:29.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Paano po yung worry ko lang po, mga senior citizens po,

asr-001567
01:04:30.080 --> 01:04:31.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung mga PWDs,

asr-001568
01:04:32.620 --> 01:04:34.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: paano po yun?

asr-001569
01:04:34.360 --> 01:04:34.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yun ho sana.

asr-001570
01:04:35.580 --> 01:04:37.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Do we have plans, Secretary, in the future siguro?

asr-001571
01:04:38.080 --> 01:04:39.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Very near future?

asr-001572
01:04:40.500 --> 01:04:42.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Baguhin natin yung structure na yan?

asr-001573
01:04:42.400 --> 01:04:43.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Magsayang na naman tayo ng pera?

asr-001574
01:04:44.760 --> 01:04:45.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001575
01:04:46.440 --> 01:04:49.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Insofar as the Puerto Princesa airport is concerned po,

asr-001576
01:04:49.160 --> 01:04:52.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ano naman ito for PPP natin ito by next year?

asr-001577
01:04:52.680 --> 01:04:55.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ito po ay isa sa mga magiging requisitos po natin

asr-001578
01:04:55.640 --> 01:04:56.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at conditions.

asr-001579
01:04:56.360 --> 01:04:57.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ito po ay isa sa mga requisitos po natin

asr-001580
01:04:57.260 --> 01:05:00.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: for PPP na gawa ng paraan

asr-001581
01:05:00.400 --> 01:05:03.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para at least maaralin nila mabuti po

asr-001582
01:05:03.520 --> 01:05:06.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kung paano natin malagyan ito ng ating PPP,

asr-001583
01:05:06.840 --> 01:05:08.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung passenger boarding bridge.

asr-001584
01:05:09.120 --> 01:05:10.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung paano gawin.

asr-001585
01:05:10.580 --> 01:05:13.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So yan naman po, moving forward nga po sinasabi natin ngayon

asr-001586
01:05:13.820 --> 01:05:17.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na lahat na po ng ating magiging disenyo,

asr-001587
01:05:17.640 --> 01:05:19.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pag hindi lang po pagdating sa terminal po,

asr-001588
01:05:19.760 --> 01:05:22.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: dapat nakahanda na, kung bakit nakaabang na po

asr-001589
01:05:22.460 --> 01:05:25.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na dapat may passenger boarding bridge.

asr-001590
01:05:25.520 --> 01:05:27.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And hindi lang po yan, if I may add po,

asr-001591
01:05:27.420 --> 01:05:29.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ganun na rin po pagdating sa ating runway.

asr-001592
01:05:30.040 --> 01:05:31.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kahit maliit na airport niyan,

asr-001593
01:05:32.000 --> 01:05:33.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: o konti lang yung pasahero,

asr-001594
01:05:33.320 --> 01:05:36.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: dapat ang runway natin minimum 2,100 na.

asr-001595
01:05:37.040 --> 01:05:38.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Bilhin na natin ngayon yung lupa,

asr-001596
01:05:39.380 --> 01:05:42.080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kasi kapag yan ginawa natin 1-4, 1-7,

asr-001597
01:05:42.500 --> 01:05:44.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: eh ganun din naman po pagdating ng araw,

asr-001598
01:05:45.040 --> 01:05:47.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: baka kailangan natin na mas mahabang runway.

asr-001599
01:05:47.660 --> 01:05:49.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So that would be the policy from now on, Mr. Chair.

asr-001600
01:05:49.800 --> 01:05:53.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So just to add, probably we have to make it a policy lahat,

asr-001601
01:05:53.600 --> 01:05:55.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: especially all those international airports,

asr-001602
01:05:55.520 --> 01:05:58.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: have to be, kailangan may tube yun.

asr-001603
01:05:58.620 --> 01:06:01.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung Puerto Princesa kasi, nakakapanghinayang,

asr-001604
01:06:01.160 --> 01:06:04.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Central Tulpo, bagong gawa, international airport,

asr-001605
01:06:04.860 --> 01:06:07.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: eh dapat ginawa na natin ng tama.

asr-001606
01:06:07.520 --> 01:06:09.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So I think from now on, we need to,

asr-001607
01:06:10.500 --> 01:06:12.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: all international airports have to be,

asr-001608
01:06:13.340 --> 01:06:17.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: have to have provisions for tubes.

asr-001609
01:06:17.840 --> 01:06:19.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We agree, Mr. Chair.

asr-001610
01:06:19.040 --> 01:06:20.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pati yung Lawag International Airport,

asr-001611
01:06:20.520 --> 01:06:23.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: just in case we will improve on it later on,

asr-001612
01:06:23.640 --> 01:06:25.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kasi international airport din yun eh.

asr-001613
01:06:25.540 --> 01:06:29.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Wala rin, parang Puerto Princesa rin yun na walang tubes.

asr-001614
01:06:29.700 --> 01:06:30.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So thank you.

asr-001615
01:06:32.900 --> 01:06:34.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailangan nila aralin ngayon.

asr-001616
01:06:34.600 --> 01:06:37.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maybe they're thinking about the design,

asr-001617
01:06:37.980 --> 01:06:42.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the facade, and more than the functionality po.

asr-001618
01:06:43.160 --> 01:06:46.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero putting a passenger boarding bridge,

asr-001619
01:06:46.620 --> 01:06:47.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: it's not that costly po eh.

asr-001620
01:06:48.100 --> 01:06:50.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang computation namin dyan is just I think 50M.

asr-001621
01:06:51.020 --> 01:06:53.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think they just have to study it po.

asr-001622
01:06:53.620 --> 01:06:55.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I don't know the structural design,

asr-001623
01:06:55.520 --> 01:06:58.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: if it can carry that load itself.

asr-001624
01:06:58.780 --> 01:07:01.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero yan po ay magiging nga po tulad ng sinabi namin,

asr-001625
01:07:01.700 --> 01:07:05.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: magiging pong parte ng mga condition at requisitos

asr-001626
01:07:05.060 --> 01:07:07.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para po pag sa PPP natin for next year

asr-001627
01:07:07.580 --> 01:07:08.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ng Puerto Princesa ko.

asr-001628
01:07:09.740 --> 01:07:11.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So Chair, I just have about three more questions.

asr-001629
01:07:12.660 --> 01:07:13.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung po sa Puerto Princesa,

asr-001630
01:07:14.060 --> 01:07:16.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kailan ho kaya natin mawapondohan po nito

asr-001631
01:07:16.520 --> 01:07:18.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung babaguhin po natin yung airport?

asr-001632
01:07:20.640 --> 01:07:23.280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung ating General Rosario.

asr-001633
01:07:23.280 --> 01:07:25.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The funding po, the 50M,

asr-001634
01:07:25.520 --> 01:07:27.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pag ilan yung boarding bridge na kakayanin po,

asr-001635
01:07:27.540 --> 01:07:28.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think CAAP,

asr-001636
01:07:28.460 --> 01:07:29.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Corporate Operating Budget,

asr-001637
01:07:29.780 --> 01:07:31.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kakayanin ng CAAP.

asr-001638
01:07:31.320 --> 01:07:34.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailan lang nila aralin po yung kung saan ilalagay.

asr-001639
01:07:35.020 --> 01:07:39.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Baka mas malaki po sa 50M per boarding bridge

asr-001640
01:07:39.620 --> 01:07:42.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: and we can program it in 2027

asr-001641
01:07:42.440 --> 01:07:44.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa corporate funds ng CAAP.

asr-001642
01:07:44.900 --> 01:07:46.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001643
01:07:47.920 --> 01:07:51.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dito naman po tayo doon na sa presentation po ninyo kanina,

asr-001644
01:07:51.860 --> 01:07:53.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa Ketari, yung railway sa Mindanao.

asr-001645
01:07:55.520 --> 01:08:01.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are we talking to foreign companies probably who can finance it?

asr-001646
01:08:01.060 --> 01:08:04.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi may mga kausap po ako when I was the chairman of our foreign relations,

asr-001647
01:08:05.360 --> 01:08:07.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I was able to talk to the French ambassador.

asr-001648
01:08:08.740 --> 01:08:12.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I'm sure maraming po interested po na ikang pumundo dyan,

asr-001649
01:08:12.540 --> 01:08:16.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ikang yung foreign assisted.

asr-001650
01:08:17.640 --> 01:08:20.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Meron ho ba kayong tinitignan ngayon para matapos po natin?

asr-001651
01:08:20.820 --> 01:08:21.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi lang yung pondo natin,

asr-001652
01:08:21.940 --> 01:08:23.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung itulungan ho tayo,

asr-001653
01:08:23.420 --> 01:08:24.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nababayaran naman natin kasi,

asr-001654
01:08:25.520 --> 01:08:28.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung magiging entire Mindanao,

asr-001655
01:08:28.540 --> 01:08:29.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: lagyan po natin,

asr-001656
01:08:29.200 --> 01:08:30.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: not only in Davao,

asr-001657
01:08:30.380 --> 01:08:31.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kundi iikot po yan,

asr-001658
01:08:32.060 --> 01:08:32.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Cotabato,

asr-001659
01:08:32.960 --> 01:08:33.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hanggang Sambuanga,

asr-001660
01:08:34.420 --> 01:08:35.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Cagayan de Oro.

asr-001661
01:08:37.700 --> 01:08:38.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001662
01:08:39.020 --> 01:08:41.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Before I give it to Yusef TJ,

asr-001663
01:08:41.680 --> 01:08:45.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: doon sa mga ibang mga pwedeng tumulong sa atin,

asr-001664
01:08:45.280 --> 01:08:46.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pagpupondo dito,

asr-001665
01:08:46.800 --> 01:08:48.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: just last week po,

asr-001666
01:08:48.140 --> 01:08:51.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kasama natin ang mahal na Pangulo dito sa India,

asr-001667
01:08:51.040 --> 01:08:51.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: isa rin po yan,

asr-001668
01:08:52.060 --> 01:08:54.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung Mindanao Rail project natin

asr-001669
01:08:54.200 --> 01:08:55.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: that we pitched to,

asr-001670
01:08:55.520 --> 01:08:57.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: to the government of India,

asr-001671
01:08:57.340 --> 01:08:59.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at they're interested naman po.

asr-001672
01:08:59.340 --> 01:09:02.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, binibigyan natin talaga ng importansya

asr-001673
01:09:02.140 --> 01:09:03.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: itong Mindanao Rail natin.

asr-001674
01:09:04.100 --> 01:09:05.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang sabi nga po ng Pangulo,

asr-001675
01:09:05.520 --> 01:09:08.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na talagang dapat yung mga infrastructure din natin,

asr-001676
01:09:08.740 --> 01:09:09.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: tulad ng mga railways,

asr-001677
01:09:10.200 --> 01:09:12.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay kailangan din po lumabas sa Metro Manila

asr-001678
01:09:12.560 --> 01:09:15.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at papunta na rin po sa Visayas at sa Mindanao.

asr-001679
01:09:15.900 --> 01:09:19.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, I think Yusef TJ can also discuss the other,

asr-001680
01:09:19.540 --> 01:09:22.760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kumbaga probable funders for our Mindanao Rail.

asr-001681
01:09:23.620 --> 01:09:24.360
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Salamat po.

asr-001682
01:09:24.360 --> 01:09:25.400
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Through the chair,

asr-001683
01:09:25.520 --> 01:09:26.940
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: and with the permission of the secretary.

asr-001684
01:09:27.980 --> 01:09:29.200
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Una po sa lahat,

asr-001685
01:09:29.520 --> 01:09:29.980
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Mr. Chair,

asr-001686
01:09:30.520 --> 01:09:32.940
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: tayo po ay tinutulungan na po

asr-001687
01:09:32.940 --> 01:09:34.980
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ng Asian Development Bank

asr-001688
01:09:34.980 --> 01:09:37.360
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: para po ma-update

asr-001689
01:09:37.360 --> 01:09:39.820
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: yun pong ating feasibility study po

asr-001690
01:09:39.820 --> 01:09:41.380
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: para sa Mindanao Rail.

asr-001691
01:09:41.900 --> 01:09:45.400
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Yung feasibility study po kasi natin

asr-001692
01:09:45.400 --> 01:09:47.600
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ay mga 2016-2017 pa po.

asr-001693
01:09:48.300 --> 01:09:50.840
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: And isa po dun sa mga requisitos

asr-001694
01:09:50.840 --> 01:09:53.340
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: para po makahanap tayo ng bagong partner

asr-001695
01:09:53.340 --> 01:09:55.280
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: na pupondo po ng proyekto,

asr-001696
01:09:55.520 --> 01:09:56.780
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ay ang ma-update po natin

asr-001697
01:09:56.780 --> 01:09:58.120
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ng ating feasibility study.

asr-001698
01:09:58.300 --> 01:10:01.120
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So, dito po ay tinutulungan na po tayo ng ADB.

asr-001699
01:10:01.840 --> 01:10:04.460
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Doon naman po sa mga pupondo nung proyekto,

asr-001700
01:10:05.140 --> 01:10:07.500
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: isa pong magandang development

asr-001701
01:10:07.500 --> 01:10:09.340
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ay nagkakaroon na po tayo

asr-001702
01:10:09.340 --> 01:10:12.480
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ng karagdagang mga government-to-government

asr-001703
01:10:12.480 --> 01:10:14.040
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: o G2G agreements

asr-001704
01:10:14.040 --> 01:10:16.580
