asr-005065
03:09:02.160 --> 03:09:07.280
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: especially po yung mga kailangan naming budget for LTMS.

asr-005066
03:09:07.420 --> 03:09:11.640
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Kasi mahabang panahon, sir, hindi po siya nabigyan po ng budget.

asr-005067
03:09:12.360 --> 03:09:16.420
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Especially po itong establishment of disaster recovery center,

asr-005068
03:09:17.060 --> 03:09:24.160
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: kung ating mga data, and also the maintenance and support services for the existing LTMS.

asr-005069
03:09:24.160 --> 03:09:26.460
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Hindi po siya nabigyan ng maintenance before.

asr-005070
03:09:26.500 --> 03:09:30.400
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: So, napaka-importante po na mas ma-maintain po natin siya.

asr-005071
03:09:30.960 --> 03:09:36.600
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: At saka po yung mga hardware refresh natin sa LTMS.

asr-005072
03:09:38.840 --> 03:09:43.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pagkano yung nire-request nyo, pahabol to, wala ito sa NEP.

asr-005073
03:09:44.280 --> 03:09:44.660
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005074
03:09:45.220 --> 03:09:53.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is for the, just for the record, is for the maintenance or yung pong aside from the establishment, yung recovery?

asr-005075
03:09:54.400 --> 03:09:55.260
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005076
03:09:55.260 --> 03:09:56.200
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: First po.

asr-005077
03:09:56.500 --> 03:10:00.840
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yung establishment ng disaster recovery center for existing LTMS.

asr-005078
03:10:01.180 --> 03:10:04.240
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Kasi yung data po natin doon para may backup po tayo.

asr-005079
03:10:04.780 --> 03:10:07.500
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Maintenance and support service for the existing LTMS.

asr-005080
03:10:07.620 --> 03:10:12.380
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Kasi wala pong naging maintenance na budget sa mahabang panahon.

asr-005081
03:10:13.140 --> 03:10:16.500
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yung refresh po ng LTMS, ganun din po.

asr-005082
03:10:16.660 --> 03:10:19.000
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Wala pong nabigyan ng refresh.

asr-005083
03:10:19.180 --> 03:10:21.880
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: E samantalang ginagamit po natin siya ang LTMS.

asr-005084
03:10:21.980 --> 03:10:23.420
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: And fully utilized po natin.

asr-005085
03:10:24.380 --> 03:10:26.460
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: And we also requested,

asr-005086
03:10:26.500 --> 03:10:31.860
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: we requested for confidential funds for our operation against,

asr-005087
03:10:32.820 --> 03:10:37.400
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: alam naman po natin, ang LTO, kami yung humaharap sa mga kolorong,

asr-005088
03:10:38.020 --> 03:10:39.820
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: may mga organized crime po yan eh.

asr-005089
03:10:40.040 --> 03:10:42.220
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: So talagang mas tinututukan po namin.

asr-005090
03:10:44.860 --> 03:10:49.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So for the record, yung LTMS is now being run by our LTO personnel?

asr-005091
03:10:50.380 --> 03:10:50.700
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005092
03:10:51.420 --> 03:10:54.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung Dermalog, are they still on board?

asr-005093
03:10:54.620 --> 03:10:55.500
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Ngayon po, sir.

asr-005094
03:10:56.500 --> 03:11:03.140
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Inaayos po namin, kasi yung maintenance, sir, importante po na, kasi sila po yung nagprograma niyan.

asr-005095
03:11:03.320 --> 03:11:08.320
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Importante na magtuloy-tuloy, kasi mas maaalalayan po nila ang LTO.

asr-005096
03:11:09.740 --> 03:11:12.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Kasi sa kanila po, sila po nag-formulate po niyan eh.

asr-005097
03:11:12.900 --> 03:11:15.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So parang support services?

asr-005098
03:11:15.280 --> 03:11:15.540
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005099
03:11:16.680 --> 03:11:21.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Seth, our sent president, baka you might want to ask.

asr-005100
03:11:21.920 --> 03:11:26.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah, Sek, nakita ko dito, no, yung value,

asr-005101
03:11:26.500 --> 03:11:29.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: presyo ng LTMS is about 3.1 billion.

asr-005102
03:11:30.520 --> 03:11:36.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I agree with you na doesn't make sense na binayaran natin isang taon na

asr-005103
03:11:36.500 --> 03:11:39.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang Stratcom ng 3 billion.

asr-005104
03:11:40.260 --> 03:11:43.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: There was one time, kanina pinakita ko na I think in 2019,

asr-005105
03:11:44.380 --> 03:11:46.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: one time binayaran natin 3 billion.

asr-005106
03:11:46.900 --> 03:11:48.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 2020, 3 billion ulit.

asr-005107
03:11:48.900 --> 03:11:50.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 2021, 3 billion ulit.

asr-005108
03:11:50.460 --> 03:11:56.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Imagine mo, yung cost ng isang software, 3.1, pero binayad natin sa kanya,

asr-005109
03:11:56.240 --> 03:12:00.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: one year lang, is 3 billion.

asr-005110
03:12:00.640 --> 03:12:04.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ngayon ang tanong ko, iba kasi yung model ni Stratcom eh.

asr-005111
03:12:04.940 --> 03:12:07.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung model nito ngayon, kay Dermalog.

asr-005112
03:12:07.900 --> 03:12:15.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero in this case, pag tinignan nyo yung feasibility nitong model na ginawa natin,

asr-005113
03:12:16.500 --> 03:12:19.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: is it much economical compared to Stratcom?

asr-005114
03:12:20.240 --> 03:12:24.680
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir. Mas economical po siya, SP.

asr-005115
03:12:24.680 --> 03:12:24.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-005116
03:12:26.240 --> 03:12:29.440
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: And Mr. Chair, mas advanced pa po.

asr-005117
03:12:29.740 --> 03:12:38.940
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: In fact, sir, kung matandaan po ninyo, nung nagkaroon ako ng crackdown sa mga smuggled na sports car,

asr-005118
03:12:40.040 --> 03:12:44.260
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: madali namin nalolocate, sir, sa LTMS at hindi kasi nakakapasok, sir, sa LTMS.

asr-005119
03:12:44.740 --> 03:12:48.780
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: So isang dahilan yun, sir, na and also sa mga OFW po natin,

asr-005120
03:12:49.260 --> 03:12:51.980
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: nari-renew ko ho yung mga driver's license nila abroad.

asr-005121
03:12:52.940 --> 03:12:55.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Hindi kagaya ho ng Stratcom, sir.

asr-005122
03:12:55.580 --> 03:13:04.640
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Na wala silang mga ganong facility or ganong sistema para mas mapadali po ang pagsiservisyo po natin sa mga tao.

asr-005123
03:13:06.340 --> 03:13:08.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong Dermalog is a German company?

asr-005124
03:13:08.880 --> 03:13:09.240
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005125
03:13:09.500 --> 03:13:14.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Na ang kanyang specialization is biometrics?

asr-005126
03:13:15.100 --> 03:13:18.400
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir. Marami ho silang mga clients abroad, especially in Malaysia.

asr-005127
03:13:19.320 --> 03:13:21.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Naging maayos naman po ang kanilang mga…

asr-005128
03:13:22.340 --> 03:13:24.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So merong proof of concept, in other words.

asr-005129
03:13:24.200 --> 03:13:24.620
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005130
03:13:24.780 --> 03:13:25.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Oo nga.

asr-005131
03:13:25.580 --> 03:13:28.660
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yung LTMS, sir, so far, kaya very vocal po ako dyan.

asr-005132
03:13:28.780 --> 03:13:30.560
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Wala tayong naging problema.

asr-005133
03:13:31.220 --> 03:13:38.440
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: In fact, mas naging advanced tayo, lalo na sa ating mga driver's license at yung mga registration ng sasakyan.

asr-005134
03:13:38.840 --> 03:13:43.080
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Nawawala po yung mga… wala sa ayos.

asr-005135
03:13:43.300 --> 03:13:48.880
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Especially po yung mga Chinese driver's license na locate po namin through LTMS, biometrics.

asr-005136
03:13:49.420 --> 03:13:50.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: So ganon siya kahalaga, sir.

asr-005137
03:13:51.460 --> 03:13:55.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Chinese driver's license, what is that?

asr-005138
03:13:55.580 --> 03:13:57.140
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Before kasi, sir, alam naman po…

asr-005139
03:13:57.140 --> 03:13:57.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa Pogo?

asr-005140
03:13:57.460 --> 03:14:08.180
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir. Before, nakakita naman natin nung very active po si, sir, nung time ng Pogo, si General Cruz.

asr-005141
03:14:09.100 --> 03:14:11.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Si Gilbert nag-crackdown ng Pogo, eh.

asr-005142
03:14:11.780 --> 03:14:23.600
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir. Marami ho kaming nakita na through LTMS kasi, sir, yung biometrics, yung last operation po namin, na-determine namin na yung Filipino name, e meron Chinese pala siya.

asr-005143
03:14:23.700 --> 03:14:25.540
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: So kasi ang ginawa nila dati, sir.

asr-005144
03:14:25.580 --> 03:14:35.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Chinese talaga yung kumukuha. Ngayon nung ito na, ang ginawa nila, nagpalit sila ng Filipino name. Pero doon sa biometrics, nakita po namin through LTMS.

asr-005145
03:14:36.380 --> 03:14:49.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay. Okay. Paano itong… Last question, Mr. Chairman. Paano itong… Kasi tinitignan ko sa news. Paano itong mga… There's an effort to refund the 13 billion?

asr-005146
03:14:50.140 --> 03:14:50.660
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005147
03:14:50.660 --> 03:15:00.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I don't know if kasama kayo, but I read in the news na may mga groups na nagpa-file ng cases to get the refund

asr-005148
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:16.320
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir. Kasi nga, yun po yung mahabang panahon na it was charged for the P169, sir. So ngayon, sir, nasa ano naman po natin, legality, atin sa humingi po kami ng tulong sa DOTR para po mas maayayos po natin yung tungkol po dyan.

asr-005149
03:15:16.620 --> 03:15:18.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang tawag nila, Coalition 169.

asr-005150
03:15:18.680 --> 03:15:18.960
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005151
03:15:19.480 --> 03:15:22.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And they're trying to refund P28 billion.

asr-005152
03:15:23.100 --> 03:15:23.460
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005153
03:15:23.640 --> 03:15:24.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kaya ba ma-refund yun?

asr-005154
03:15:24.880 --> 03:15:30.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Hindi ko po masagot ngayon yan, sir. Pero pinatitingnan po namin yung legality at saka kung paano po.

asr-005155
03:15:31.080 --> 03:15:35.920
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Hindi ko rin alam bakit po sa mahabang panahon kasi naganyan yung mga kababayan natin.

asr-005156
03:15:36.180 --> 03:15:46.800
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: So kawawa po. Sa totoo lang, mabigat po talaga yung P169. Nakala kasi sa iba magaan pero sa masa, mabigat po yun.

asr-005157
03:15:46.940 --> 03:15:50.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But pag sinuma mo yan, biro mo P3 billion a year.

asr-005158
03:15:50.360 --> 03:15:50.760
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005159
03:15:50.760 --> 03:15:53.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's the exact cost of the system na binili nyo.

asr-005160
03:15:53.720 --> 03:15:54.100
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005161
03:15:54.100 --> 03:15:54.860
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Magagamit natin.

asr-005162
03:15:54.880 --> 03:15:56.020
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Magagamit natin sa mahabang panahon.

asr-005163
03:15:56.120 --> 03:15:57.700
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: And mas maayos pa po yung sistema, sir.

asr-005164
03:15:58.140 --> 03:15:58.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you. Thank you, Asec.

asr-005165
03:16:00.220 --> 03:16:01.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, our Senate President.

asr-005166
03:16:04.540 --> 03:16:16.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So yung additional request, Asec, for the maintenance and yung pag-setup ng inyong recovery disaster, how much is that?

asr-005167
03:16:16.160 --> 03:16:18.800
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: The total amount, sir, is P4.2 billion, sir.

asr-005168
03:16:19.500 --> 03:16:22.340
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: For the disaster recovery, P2.6.

asr-005169
03:16:23.240 --> 03:16:24.660
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Maintenance support service.

asr-005170
03:16:24.880 --> 03:16:26.120
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: It's P161.

asr-005171
03:16:26.760 --> 03:16:29.580
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Hardware refresh, P1.3.

asr-005172
03:16:29.680 --> 03:16:31.820
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: And our confidential funds for P50.

asr-005173
03:16:32.880 --> 03:16:35.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's additional fund for the whole agency?

asr-005174
03:16:35.600 --> 03:16:36.000
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005175
03:16:36.640 --> 03:16:42.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero yun doon po sa kailangan nyo lang na maintenance and yung pag-setup ng recovery system?

asr-005176
03:16:43.140 --> 03:16:47.900
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yung maintenance, sir, P161 million.

asr-005177
03:16:48.240 --> 03:16:50.320
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: P2.6 po yung disaster recovery.

asr-005178
03:16:51.000 --> 03:16:54.020
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Tsaka po, P1.3 po yung hardware refresh po natin.

asr-005179
03:16:54.880 --> 03:16:56.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Again, again, for the record.

asr-005180
03:16:57.160 --> 03:17:06.060
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yun pong disaster recovery center for existing LTMS is P2.7, P2.699.

asr-005181
03:17:06.100 --> 03:17:07.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito yung P2.7 billion?

asr-005182
03:17:07.460 --> 03:17:07.860
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005183
03:17:08.120 --> 03:17:13.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But what does it include?

asr-005184
03:17:13.740 --> 03:17:16.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: O totally ano lang yun? Database na na total?

asr-005185
03:17:16.720 --> 03:17:18.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Parang resistance redundancy?

asr-005186
03:17:18.580 --> 03:17:18.880
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005187
03:17:18.880 --> 03:17:19.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Am I correct?

asr-005188
03:17:19.300 --> 03:17:19.620
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005189
03:17:20.120 --> 03:17:24.560
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: And for the maintenance support service, P161 million.

asr-005190
03:17:24.880 --> 03:17:31.380
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Doon naman po sa hardware refresh of the existing LTMS na primary data center.

asr-005191
03:17:31.540 --> 03:17:36.980
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Kasi ito po yung hindi rin talaga pinondohan ng mahabang panahon as P1.3 billion po, sir.

asr-005192
03:17:39.080 --> 03:17:49.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is there, kasi medyo malalaki rin ito, you know, for the fact that alam ng ating Senate President being the former Finance Chair that our fiscal space rate right now is really limited.

asr-005193
03:17:50.680 --> 03:17:51.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano po yan?

asr-005194
03:17:51.220 --> 03:17:54.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Can you give, submit to us yung talagang...

asr-005195
03:17:54.880 --> 03:18:10.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bare minimum, para po dito, so that yung masimulan na yung kanina, yung disaster recovery, yung sa maintenance, yung yung refresh, hindi naman siguro kaya ito in one, kailangan ito in one year, all of this amount because this is quite big.

asr-005196
03:18:11.160 --> 03:18:23.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So siguro for this year, ano lang yung kailangan para lang masimulan natin so that, you know, at least hindi tayo matakot na in case there is a breakdown or calamity, at least nandun yung ating pong records.

asr-005197
03:18:24.520 --> 03:18:24.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And also...

asr-005198
03:18:24.880 --> 03:18:38.060
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir. Mr. Chair, mag-send po kami. Pero yun nga po, yun po yung aming nire-request sana, pero mag-adjust po kami kung ano po yung mga papwede na.

asr-005199
03:18:38.760 --> 03:18:48.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero ano lang yan, as pointed out by our Senate President, it's, yung P3 billion is just one year for the former service provider.

asr-005200
03:18:48.320 --> 03:18:48.640
LTO Assistant Secretary Markus V. Lacanilao: Yes, sir.

asr-005201
03:18:48.680 --> 03:18:54.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: No? So, but we'll see. Kasi medyo masigit talaga yung ano natin yung fiscal space. Okay?

asr-005202
03:18:54.880 --> 03:19:05.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, we can move on. Siguro I'll just have a couple of questions from, for the Secretary and the other agencies.

asr-005203
03:19:05.560 --> 03:19:24.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dun po sa ano, no? Sa DOTR proposed 898.499 billion for right-of-way acquisition for 2027. But the NEP provides only 2.79 billion, a reduction of about 97.17% from the Department's proposal.

asr-005204
03:19:24.880 --> 03:19:36.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Right-of-way has been a perennial problem not only for the DOTR, but across government agencies like DPWH. And it has repeatedly contributed to delays in major infrastructure projects.

asr-005205
03:19:36.520 --> 03:19:54.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ang question, what will be the impact of this substantial reduction on the implementation timelines of your major transportation projects? In particular, of course, yung ating NECR and Metro Manila Subway, more specifically, and also which project...

asr-005206
03:19:54.520 --> 03:20:03.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What other projects require right-of-way funding in 2027, no? But receive no allocation under the NEP. Sige, hasik.

asr-005207
03:20:04.360 --> 03:20:09.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Simulan ko po, Mr. Chairman, dito sa ating RILES po, no?

asr-005208
