DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: dahil po wala po tayong pambayad doon po sa maapektuhan natin na landowner po.

asr-005627
03:30:19.040 --> 03:30:27.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For the record, how long already yung ating diggings, yung tunneling natin?

asr-005628
03:30:27.560 --> 03:30:34.220
