asr-005636
03:30:59.600 --> 03:31:04.520
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So iba-iba po yung timing nung umpisa po ng tunneling natin.

asr-005637
03:31:04.940 --> 03:31:11.400
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Pero on average po, ang nakikita po natin na actual progress ng mga tunnel boring machines natin,

asr-005638
03:31:11.520 --> 03:31:18.260
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: meron po tayong labing siyam para po sa subway, ay nasa 5 to 12 meters per day, Mr. Chair.

asr-005639
03:31:19.720 --> 03:31:20.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you.

asr-005640
03:31:21.040 --> 03:31:23.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Doon sa North-South Commuter Railway,

asr-005641
03:31:23.300 --> 03:31:28.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it receives one of the largest allocations for the entire right-of-way,

asr-005642
03:31:29.780 --> 03:31:32.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: also for the entire DOTR budget.

asr-005643
03:31:33.520 --> 03:31:41.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But yung ating right-of-way request was reduced from 23.89 billion to 2.79 billion.

asr-005644
03:31:42.760 --> 03:31:50.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is the remaining right-of-way allocation sufficient to support the construction schedule funded under the 2027 budget?

asr-005645
03:31:50.520 --> 03:31:52.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Considering the next year, di ba?

asr-005646
03:31:53.300 --> 03:31:57.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Matay, tumakbo na sana ito by December 2027.

asr-005647
03:31:57.240 --> 03:31:58.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And also, full blast na rin.

asr-005648
03:31:59.520 --> 03:32:04.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As I understand, nag-increase na rin yung inyong utilization and all,

asr-005649
03:32:04.680 --> 03:32:07.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at saka yung sa ating construction.

asr-005650
03:32:07.820 --> 03:32:09.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, yun.

asr-005651
03:32:09.500 --> 03:32:16.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What will be affected from 23 billion naging 2.79 billion sa right-of-way?

asr-005652
03:32:18.240 --> 03:32:22.220
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Mr. Chair, doon po sa ating partial...

asr-005653
03:32:23.300 --> 03:32:25.240
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Partial operations po para next year.

asr-005654
03:32:25.360 --> 03:32:26.180
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Okay na po tayo na po.

asr-005655
03:32:26.520 --> 03:32:28.740
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Okay na po tayo na po natin yung right-of-way.

asr-005656
03:32:28.840 --> 03:32:30.180
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Nakatayo na po ang Civil Works.

asr-005657
03:32:30.340 --> 03:32:36.080
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Para po doon sa 28 kilometers, 7 stations po na Valenzuela to Malolos.

asr-005658
03:32:36.200 --> 03:32:38.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro question na, just to add before you answer.

asr-005659
03:32:38.160 --> 03:32:43.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What percentage of the total right-of-way of the NECR has already been acquired?

asr-005660
03:32:43.760 --> 03:32:46.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And which specific segments remain problematic?

asr-005661
03:32:47.680 --> 03:32:53.160
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Mr. Chair, overall po yung buong North-South Commuter Rail ay nasa 78% po na right-of-way.

asr-005662
03:32:53.300 --> 03:32:59.980
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Yun pong N1 segment natin, yung sa gitna po, ay nasa 99% na po tayo.

asr-005663
03:33:00.080 --> 03:33:03.760
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So, ito po yung kasama po yung magbubukas po next year.

asr-005664
03:33:04.180 --> 03:33:10.180
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Yun pong N2 segment, yung North-South segment po natin papuntang Clark, ay nasa 86% po tayo.

asr-005665
03:33:10.620 --> 03:33:14.420
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Kailangan po po natin ng mga 2 billion para po doon sa papuntang Clark.

asr-005666
03:33:15.020 --> 03:33:22.280
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: At doon po sa South natin, yung mula po Maynila papuntang Calamba, ay nasa 64% pa lang po tayo.

asr-005667
03:33:22.680 --> 03:33:23.240
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Actually,

asr-005668
03:33:23.300 --> 03:33:32.240
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: upon the guidance po of our Secretary, yung South po, we need to make a critical decision po in the next few months.

asr-005669
03:33:32.780 --> 03:33:39.920
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Dahil sa kasalukuyan po, ay nauubusan na po ng workable, na right-of-way, workable site,

asr-005670
03:33:40.100 --> 03:33:42.620
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ang aming mga contractors doon po sa South.

asr-005671
03:33:43.160 --> 03:33:50.800
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So, kung hindi po kami makakakuha ng dagdag na budget, at nasa more than 20 billion po ang kailangan namin para sa South,

asr-005672
03:33:53.300 --> 03:33:59.220
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: yung potential po na gagawin namin ay magpa-demobilize na po ng mga contractors sa South

asr-005673
03:33:59.220 --> 03:34:07.080
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: para po mabawasan yung exposure natin sa prolongation cost, standby cost, at iba pong delay-related cost.

asr-005674
03:34:07.320 --> 03:34:12.200
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: So, that will be the effect kung hindi natin ma-prioritize yung right-of-way acquisition.

asr-005675
03:34:12.620 --> 03:34:21.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, Mr. Chairman, Your Honors. Yun po yung sinasabi natin ngayon na kapag wala talaga pondo, we have to minimize and cut our losses.

asr-005676
03:34:21.840 --> 03:34:25.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: No, nakatingga po mo ngayon, wala na nga tayo.

asr-005677
03:34:25.160 --> 03:34:32.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, hindi lang po yun, Mr. Chairman, habang matagal po tayo ng pagpo-pondo ng right-of-way, tataas yung presyo eh.

asr-005678
03:34:32.960 --> 03:34:33.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Lahat, I think.

asr-005679
03:34:33.700 --> 03:34:34.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Lahat, tataas.

asr-005680
03:34:34.500 --> 03:34:35.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Magdi-demobilize ka.

asr-005681
03:34:35.800 --> 03:34:37.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Magdi-demobilize ulit.

asr-005682
03:34:38.000 --> 03:34:38.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes.

asr-005683
03:34:38.540 --> 03:34:42.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron pang inflation, may dollar depreciation pa.

asr-005684
03:34:42.280 --> 03:34:42.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po.

asr-005685
03:34:42.580 --> 03:34:48.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I think when we computed this first time, nasa 40 plus lang yung dollar peso ngayon.

asr-005686
03:34:48.160 --> 03:34:48.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po.

asr-005687
03:34:48.900 --> 03:34:49.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 62 na.

asr-005688
03:34:49.760 --> 03:34:50.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 63.

asr-005689
03:34:50.040 --> 03:34:51.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 63 na.

asr-005690
03:34:51.840 --> 03:34:57.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, kesa naman matingga po at dumagdag pa yung gastusin ng gobyerno, pati utang.

asr-005691
03:34:57.880 --> 03:35:03.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, sabi nga po namin with rail, we have to make a very critical decision.

asr-005692
03:35:04.340 --> 03:35:10.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung walang right-of-way, partial demobilize ka na lang para you won't charge us with prolongation cost.

asr-005693
03:35:11.160 --> 03:35:19.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How much is the, yun lang ulit bare minimum, yun sa south na yan, para at least hindi tayo, we don't necessarily have to demobilize.

asr-005694
03:35:19.680 --> 03:35:21.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sir, we're going to identify.

asr-005695
03:35:21.840 --> 03:35:26.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, we're going to identify certain areas na sa tingin namin kailangang mas bibigyan prioridad.

asr-005696
03:35:26.140 --> 03:35:27.960
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At yun lang na naman po ang susumiti namin.

asr-005697
03:35:28.040 --> 03:35:29.680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We're not going to ask for the entire po.

asr-005698
03:35:30.080 --> 03:35:32.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, we're going to identify certain areas po.

asr-005699
03:35:33.120 --> 03:35:39.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Parang I think yung mas madali na right-of-way, isa sa mga pag-usapan namin, Santa Mesa and Paco.

asr-005700
03:35:39.500 --> 03:35:42.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, may mga areas po gano'n na titignan po namin.

asr-005701
03:35:42.840 --> 03:35:44.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Para yun lang po yung ingin namin ng budget po.

asr-005702
03:35:44.580 --> 03:35:45.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi yun ang pare.

asr-005703
03:35:45.500 --> 03:35:46.060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dapat ngayon.

asr-005704
03:35:46.220 --> 03:35:47.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's a difficult decision.

asr-005705
03:35:48.040 --> 03:35:50.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi maaari mag-cut loss tayo ngayon.

asr-005706
03:35:51.140 --> 03:35:51.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May na-demobilize.

asr-005707
03:35:51.840 --> 03:35:55.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But later on, tataas na presyo.

asr-005708
03:35:55.960 --> 03:36:00.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mamaya magkaroon ng depreciation na naman, inflation, etc.

asr-005709
03:36:00.820 --> 03:36:03.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, let us know.

asr-005710
03:36:03.240 --> 03:36:04.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At least, andito ang Senate President.

asr-005711
03:36:04.580 --> 03:36:10.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We'll try to figure a way on how to prevent this.

asr-005712
03:36:10.280 --> 03:36:11.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi ayaw na natin.

asr-005713
03:36:11.980 --> 03:36:12.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maaari makatibid tayo.

asr-005714
03:36:13.020 --> 03:36:14.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero problema yung future.

asr-005715
03:36:14.680 --> 03:36:15.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Waka mamaya.

asr-005716
03:36:15.580 --> 03:36:17.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In the future, we will end up spending more.

asr-005717
03:36:18.460 --> 03:36:19.400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005718
03:36:19.960 --> 03:36:21.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Let us assure, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005719
03:36:21.840 --> 03:36:24.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Senate President, that the amount we're going to ask

asr-005720
03:36:24.040 --> 03:36:26.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: is not unreasonable, but realistic po.

asr-005721
03:36:26.780 --> 03:36:28.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung magagamit lang po namin.

asr-005722
03:36:28.060 --> 03:36:28.880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung bare minimum lang.

asr-005723
03:36:28.960 --> 03:36:30.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi hindi rin naman tayo, ano yan.

asr-005724
03:36:30.260 --> 03:36:33.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We are really limited because of our fiscal cap, no?

asr-005725
03:36:33.180 --> 03:36:33.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Fiscal space.

asr-005726
03:36:35.960 --> 03:36:39.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just to interject, with your permission, Chairman.

asr-005727
03:36:40.100 --> 03:36:42.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung bag-write-off way, we expropriate, di ba?

asr-005728
03:36:43.760 --> 03:36:44.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's how we do it.

asr-005729
03:36:44.960 --> 03:36:46.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yes, we expropriate.

asr-005730
03:36:46.400 --> 03:36:48.320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: That's the last resort.

asr-005731
03:36:48.640 --> 03:36:49.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, the first is negotiation.

asr-005732
03:36:49.920 --> 03:36:51.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Deed of donation, ha?

asr-005733
03:36:51.840 --> 03:36:52.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Deed of donation.

asr-005734
03:36:52.720 --> 03:36:54.080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kapag may, kapag siniswerte.

asr-005735
03:36:54.100 --> 03:36:55.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero wala nang bang gagawa yan.

asr-005736
03:36:55.360 --> 03:36:58.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Walang private, pero mga iba mo may nagdo-donate.

asr-005737
03:36:58.120 --> 03:36:58.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ah, meron po.

asr-005738
03:36:58.920 --> 03:37:00.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: For the first time, may nag-donate po.

asr-005739
03:37:00.580 --> 03:37:01.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Billiard group po.

asr-005740
03:37:01.600 --> 03:37:01.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah, yes.

asr-005741
03:37:02.240 --> 03:37:06.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But that's once in the blue moon siguro yan, no?

asr-005742
03:37:07.180 --> 03:37:08.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then you negotiate.

asr-005743
03:37:08.540 --> 03:37:09.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Negotiate, yes.

asr-005744
03:37:09.240 --> 03:37:11.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero hindi mag-agree sa presyo, for sure.

asr-005745
03:37:11.780 --> 03:37:14.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Meron na po ngayon because of the ARO Act.

asr-005746
03:37:14.520 --> 03:37:17.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Now, the prices right now that we offer to them

asr-005747
03:37:17.820 --> 03:37:18.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: is higher.

asr-005748
03:37:19.000 --> 03:37:21.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: It's more reasonable and realistic.

asr-005749
03:37:21.840 --> 03:37:25.800
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, if you notice po, based on our study din po

asr-005750
03:37:25.800 --> 03:37:29.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at sa documents submitted with our right-of-way team,

asr-005751
03:37:29.300 --> 03:37:33.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: mas madami na rin pong pumapayag for a negotiated sale.

