03:44:12.620 --> 03:44:15.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I think we would need that in the future.

asr-005960
03:44:15.820 --> 03:44:17.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So do we still need

asr-005961
03:44:17.220 --> 03:44:18.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to fund

