03:44:20.880 --> 03:44:22.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with the project management office

asr-005964
03:44:22.580 --> 03:44:24.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para po dito, para hindi masayang?

asr-005965
03:44:25.240 --> 03:44:26.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang tingin nyo, ah, Sekretary?

asr-005966
03:44:27.080 --> 03:44:29.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo, we have to

asr-005967
03:44:29.220 --> 03:44:31.780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: still fund the PMO po.

asr-005968
03:44:32.220 --> 03:44:33.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi po nga po,

asr-005969
03:44:33.460 --> 03:44:35.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ito rin po, importante yung

asr-005970
03:44:35.180 --> 03:44:36.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: right of way dito po, no?

asr-005971
03:44:36.680 --> 03:44:38.620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya yun, pinupush namin, kahit wala pang

asr-005972
03:44:38.620 --> 03:44:40.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: loan, no?

asr-005973
03:44:40.940 --> 03:44:42.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailan natin makuha yung right of way.

asr-005974
03:44:42.800 --> 03:44:44.720
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At dito na po, pinanggagalingan namin.

asr-005975
03:44:44.840 --> 03:44:46.940
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang kagandaan dito, pag nakuha mo na yung right of way,

asr-005976
03:44:47.540 --> 03:44:48.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kahit nasin upayin mo po,

asr-005977
03:44:49.120 --> 03:44:50.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pagdating ng araw, pag wala na po,

asr-005978
03:44:50.840 --> 03:44:52.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kami, hindi nyo na kayo,

asr-005979
03:44:52.800 --> 03:44:54.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I mean, mahirap pa na siya baguhin

asr-005980
03:44:54.540 --> 03:44:56.380
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang alignment. Kasi andyan na yung right of way.

asr-005981
03:44:56.460 --> 03:44:58.700
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi na pa iba-iba ang magiging

asr-005982
03:44:58.700 --> 03:44:59.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: proyekto.

asr-005983
03:45:00.000 --> 03:45:07.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi habang, kapag wala kayong nakuha ang right-of-way, pwede pa akong baguhin yan ng alignment, kung ano man.

asr-005984
03:45:08.300 --> 03:45:10.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At tatagal na naman ang proyekto.

asr-005985
03:45:10.700 --> 03:45:17.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So kunin mo right-of-way, makakatipid ka sa gastusin sa right-of-way, kasi tumataas naman lahat ng presyo pagdating sa lupa eh.

asr-005986
03:45:18.060 --> 03:45:25.540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Para kapag may pondo na para sa infrastructure, kung sino man uupo pagdating ng araw, just implement the project, kasi nandiyan na po yung right-of-way.

asr-005987
03:45:25.540 --> 03:45:33.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The right-of-way is not simple as pagbili ng lupa. May mga right-of-way activities pa dyan na kailangan gawin.

asr-005988
03:45:33.720 --> 03:45:40.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailangan mong ilipat kung mayroon pang mga nakatira dyan. So it's a long process, but we have to start now.

asr-005989
03:45:42.760 --> 03:45:48.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Actually, yun sa Tagum to Digos, alam ko mayroon ng mga nasibulan.

asr-005990
03:45:49.240 --> 03:45:54.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In fact, sa akin wala si Senator De La Rosa rito. Bahay niya, isa sa mga napekto niya tayo.

asr-005991
03:45:55.540 --> 03:46:05.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay. That's why we are pushing. I'm thankful to the Senate President for prioritizing Senate Bill No. 2,

asr-005992
03:46:05.760 --> 03:46:17.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung Master Plan for Infrastructure and National Development. Kasama mo na. I think kasama mo ito sa mga talagang magbe-benefit to pag naipasa natin yung Master Plan.

asr-005993
03:46:18.200 --> 03:46:22.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kahit sino umupo, talagang dapat tuloy-tuloy na. And I think yan yung sinasabi niya.

asr-005994
03:46:22.300 --> 03:46:25.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, let us admit to us also.

asr-005995
03:46:25.540 --> 03:46:32.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kung magkano yung bare minimum for the project management para yung tama yung alignment, yung research, study, right of way.

asr-005996
03:46:33.240 --> 03:46:41.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At least nandyan. So pag mayroon na nag-takeover na entity, whoever it is, sana kung G2G o anuman, nakaready tayo.

asr-005997
03:46:42.040 --> 03:46:47.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi mahirap to start from scratch. Pag mawala ang project management office, we start from scratch.

asr-005998
03:46:47.820 --> 03:46:52.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I think kami ni Senate President, we came from one of the parliamentary visits.

asr-005999
03:46:52.900 --> 03:46:55.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We had the chance to have...

asr-006000
03:46:55.540 --> 03:46:57.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: An audience with the King of Spain.

asr-006001
03:46:58.340 --> 03:47:05.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And since ano sila, manufacturer sila ng local macars, no?

asr-006002
03:47:05.640 --> 03:47:08.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lagi yung Cafiata, Spanya, Spanish.

asr-006003
03:47:09.180 --> 03:47:14.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They're interested to go back to the Philippines, considering that we were once their colony.

asr-006004
03:47:15.300 --> 03:47:16.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: No? Na parang they're interested.

asr-006005
03:47:17.060 --> 03:47:21.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So I think they're scheduled, he's scheduled to, the Spanish is scheduled next year.

asr-006006
03:47:21.700 --> 03:47:25.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So probably, isa sa pwede natin consider itong Spain.

asr-006007
03:47:25.540 --> 03:47:30.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nakausap namin no, with the Senate President and then-Senate President Zubiri.

asr-006008
03:47:32.620 --> 03:47:35.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron na question from Senator Joel Villanueva.

asr-006009
03:47:35.640 --> 03:47:42.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: He raises concern regarding the North NCR project or North Trail project along MacArthur Highway

asr-006010
03:47:42.800 --> 03:47:46.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in Bulacan, construction debris and heavy field material.

asr-006011
03:47:46.480 --> 03:47:47.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ay bakit North Trail pa to?

asr-006012
03:47:48.340 --> 03:47:55.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And heavy field materials have reported black natural waterways, worsening severe flooding in Malolos,

asr-006013
03:47:55.180 --> 03:47:56.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Paumbong, and Pulilan.

asr-006014
03:47:57.280 --> 03:48:00.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nagpapatayo ng trend pero binabahan naman yung komunidad.

asr-006015
03:48:01.040 --> 03:48:04.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano po ang nangyari dito? Bakit nakaharang ang mga heavy equipment sa waterways?

asr-006016
03:48:04.960 --> 03:48:07.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So from Senator Joel Villanueva.

asr-006017
03:48:07.700 --> 03:48:14.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is that the OTR employing corrective measures to clean this clogged waterways in Bulacan?

asr-006018
03:48:16.980 --> 03:48:18.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, our Senate President.

asr-006019
03:48:18.140 --> 03:48:25.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam ni Yusek Batan to kasi, and si Yusek Batan has been super helpful in the case of Valenzuela.

asr-006020
03:48:25.180 --> 03:48:31.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Secretary, just to susundan ko lang po yung tanong ni Senator Joel.

asr-006021
03:48:32.000 --> 03:48:38.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Talagang meron pong tatabunan na mga natural waterways yung NSCR.

asr-006022
03:48:38.400 --> 03:48:43.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Like in the case of Valenzuela, nung mayor po ako, meron tinatawag po kami dyan PNR Creek.

asr-006023
03:48:43.740 --> 03:48:52.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam ni Yusek Batan na nung tinayo yung NSCR, siguro inadvertently naman, natambakan nila.

asr-006024
03:48:54.360 --> 03:48:55.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So...

asr-006025
03:48:55.080 --> 03:48:57.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pumingi ako ng permission sa DOTR, nabuhay namin yun.

asr-006026
03:48:58.300 --> 03:49:02.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Unfortunately, hindi na bumalik sa natural state niya.

asr-006027
03:49:02.540 --> 03:49:03.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dati kasi malaki yun eh.

asr-006028
03:49:04.140 --> 03:49:05.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So ngayon maliit.

asr-006029
03:49:05.120 --> 03:49:08.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So we're working with DPWH na gawin na talagang box culvert.

asr-006030
03:49:09.920 --> 03:49:13.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then, that goes all the way to Maikawayan.

asr-006031
03:49:13.840 --> 03:49:15.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So sa Valenzuela, maayos namin.

asr-006032
03:49:15.780 --> 03:49:19.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang problema naman sa Maikawayan, which is not our jurisdiction anymore.

asr-006033
03:49:19.900 --> 03:49:23.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi mas maraming obstruction doon.

asr-006034
03:49:23.080 --> 03:49:24.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I...

asr-006035
03:49:25.080 --> 03:49:26.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I agree with Senator Joel.

asr-006036
03:49:27.040 --> 03:49:31.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I-review natin yung mga natatamaan ng NSCR along the way.

asr-006037
03:49:32.480 --> 03:49:33.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tingin ko hindi naman sinasadya.

asr-006038
03:49:34.100 --> 03:49:40.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think dahil mabilis yung construction, baka natatambakan nila.

asr-006039
03:49:41.200 --> 03:49:45.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And itong PNR Creek, tinatanong ko kung anong history.

asr-006040
03:49:45.200 --> 03:49:46.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's not a natural creek.

asr-006041
03:49:47.720 --> 03:49:50.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's a man-made creek made by PNR.

asr-006042
03:49:50.380 --> 03:49:51.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Na naging...

asr-006043
03:49:52.320 --> 03:49:54.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Parang naging natural outflow na ng...

asr-006044
03:49:55.080 --> 03:49:55.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: MacArthur Highway.

asr-006045
03:49:56.120 --> 03:50:01.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, my suggestion is to be alert on those type of creeks.

asr-006046
03:50:02.160 --> 03:50:04.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dahil, kaya binabaha...

asr-006047
03:50:04.560 --> 03:50:07.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: A large part of MacArthur is because yung outflow nawala na eh.

asr-006048
03:50:08.520 --> 03:50:10.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, alam to ni Yusik Batan.

asr-006049
03:50:10.640 --> 03:50:13.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And he's very helpful in recovering that.

asr-006050
03:50:13.960 --> 03:50:19.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But moving forward, I will also raise this with DPWH na gawin na talagang box culvert.

asr-006051
03:50:19.960 --> 03:50:23.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sabi sa akin ni Yusik, hindi kasali kasi ito sa loan natin.

asr-006052
03:50:23.720 --> 03:50:24.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kaya, kailangan...

asr-006053
03:50:25.080 --> 03:50:26.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kailangan tayo nagagawa nun.

asr-006054
03:50:26.300 --> 03:50:36.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I will request from DPWH na hindi lang Valenzuela, kundi yung mga iwang parts, gawin ng box culvert para maging natural outflow na MacArthur.

asr-006055
03:50:36.220 --> 03:50:41.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kaya, pag makikita ni Yusik, yung MacArthur, ang daming baha.

asr-006056
03:50:41.520 --> 03:50:45.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Valenzuela, Maikawayan, Marilao, Bukawi.

asr-006057
03:50:45.300 --> 03:50:49.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Lahat ng dinaanan ng NSCR, nagbaha na ngayon.

asr-006058
03:50:50.680 --> 03:50:52.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ganyan experience si Senator Joel.

asr-006059
03:50:52.560 --> 03:50:53.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ganyan din experience namin.

asr-006060
03:50:54.500 --> 03:50:55.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ano?

asr-006061
03:50:55.080 --> 03:50:56.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may...

asr-006062
03:50:56.980 --> 03:51:00.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may...

asr-006063
03:51:00.900 --> 03:51:14.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nag-usap po kami ng Secretary Vince, maybe next week po, sa sunod na linggo, mayroon na po pagpupulong kasama mga contractors, kasama ang DOTR, sa NSCR.

asr-006064
03:51:14.660 --> 03:51:18.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At basically, the same issue po, yun yung we have to address.

asr-006065
03:51:18.980 --> 03:51:22.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At nagtilignan namin naman namin yung alignment.

asr-006066
03:51:22.140 --> 03:51:24.640
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kung may kailangan ng corrective measures po.

asr-006067
03:51:25.080 --> 03:51:28.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa DOTR, sa ating mga contractor, gagawin po namin.

asr-006068
03:51:29.320 --> 03:51:34.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But if I may just add po, Mr. Chairman and Mr. Senate President,

asr-006069
03:51:34.960 --> 03:51:42.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: itong design po na to, design po to ng mga Japanese, NJICA approved din po to.

asr-006070
03:51:43.020 --> 03:51:49.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At tama po kayo, baka may mga certain construction areas na hindi naman ho yata sinasadya

asr-006071
03:51:49.820 --> 03:51:53.240
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: o baka nagkamali din po sa paglalagay ng mga viaduct.

asr-006072
03:51:53.380 --> 03:51:54.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya, mas lalong...

asr-006073
03:51:54.820 --> 03:51:57.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi nakakatulong sa pagbawas ng baha.

asr-006074
03:51:58.240 --> 03:52:03.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero yung mga tulad ng ating mga istasyon po dito sa West Valenzuela,

asr-006075
03:52:03.920 --> 03:52:08.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ang kagandahan po ng ating istasyon dito sa West Valenzuela, sa NSCR,

asr-006076
03:52:08.360 --> 03:52:13.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung mismong istasyon po, part of the design of the contractor,

asr-006077
03:52:13.700 --> 03:52:17.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the Japanese government and NJICA, may sariling detention basin po doon.

asr-006078
03:52:18.560 --> 03:52:23.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At nakita po yan kahapon ni Senator JV, pinakita natin yung sariling detention basin.

asr-006079
03:52:24.080 --> 03:52:24.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Actually, there were...

asr-006080
03:52:24.820 --> 03:52:27.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: There were two detention basins doon mismo sa istasyon.

asr-006081
03:52:28.100 --> 03:52:28.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo.

asr-006082
03:52:28.980 --> 03:52:29.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo.

asr-006083
03:52:29.440 --> 03:52:29.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Meron na po.

asr-006084
