asr-006232-split-2
04:24:41.700 --> 04:24:59.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro please let us know para updates na rin tsaka kung naayos natin yung issue rito sa cap. I think it's very important kasi meron din naman tayong ibang transport sector, the older transport sectors that we have to also think of, na hindi naman siguro natin pwedeng pabayaan. Okay,

asr-006233
04:25:00.000 --> 04:25:11.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: so since I'm one of those who pushed for the pilot implementation of the motorcycle taxi, please let us—

asr-006233-split-2
04:25:11.400 --> 04:25:14.200
