asr-007237
04:47:11.040 --> 04:47:14.680
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: For one, we already issued the press release.

asr-007238
04:47:15.900 --> 04:47:26.740
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We have been banking on information as our strongest, the most potent weapon in this kind of game we're in.

asr-007239
04:47:27.520 --> 04:47:29.080
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, we have released the PR already.

asr-007240
04:47:29.200 --> 04:47:33.560
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We are informing the world that China has behaved this way again.

asr-007241
04:47:35.840 --> 04:47:45.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Saka ano na to, talagang they're still becoming very, very hostile and aggressive na itong they rammed our Bifar vessel.

asr-007242
04:47:47.320 --> 04:47:49.660
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, Mr. Chairman.

asr-007243
04:47:50.460 --> 04:47:56.920
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We have to remember that Bifar vessel is manned by civilian sailors, actually.

asr-007244
04:47:57.520 --> 04:47:59.320
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Hindi po yan armed.

asr-007245
04:47:59.860 --> 04:48:03.780
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It's just there to distribute support to our fishermen.

asr-007246
04:48:05.280 --> 04:48:13.100
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, it is very unfortunate to see a public vessel treated like that by China Coast Guard.

asr-007247
04:48:14.100 --> 04:48:14.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano na ito, no?

asr-007248
04:48:14.980 --> 04:48:19.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Talagang this is really a disrespect to our sovereignty.

asr-007249
04:48:20.520 --> 04:48:22.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And wala nang respeto talaga, eh, no?

asr-007250
04:48:23.280 --> 04:48:24.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, did you...

asr-007251
04:48:24.960 --> 04:48:26.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Also, every time...

asr-007252
04:48:27.520 --> 04:48:29.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: There's an incident.

asr-007253
04:48:29.340 --> 04:48:34.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Do you report this to the DFA para magsulat ng diplomatic protest?

asr-007254
04:48:34.900 --> 04:48:40.600
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We are part of the National Task Force on the West Philippine Sea and DFA is part of it.

asr-007255
04:48:41.180 --> 04:48:41.720
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Your Honor.

asr-007256
04:48:44.000 --> 04:48:44.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-007257
04:48:45.120 --> 04:48:57.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Considering the 57.5% cut to our capital outlays and the 3.3 billion reduction in air,

asr-007258
04:48:57.520 --> 04:49:00.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and floating asset acquisition and maintenance,

asr-007259
04:49:00.900 --> 04:49:02.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: medyo malaki pala, ano, no?

asr-007260
04:49:02.940 --> 04:49:09.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How will the PCG maintain adequate sea-based patrols in the critical areas like West Philippine Sea?

asr-007261
04:49:09.220 --> 04:49:15.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, 3.3 billion pa na ang reduction natin from the NEP for the acquisition of air and floating assets.

asr-007262
04:49:18.980 --> 04:49:25.080
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It will significantly compromise our operational ability, Your Honor.

asr-007263
04:49:25.480 --> 04:49:26.660
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We are already operating...

asr-007264
04:49:27.520 --> 04:49:29.160
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: at the maximum.

asr-007265
04:49:30.420 --> 04:49:37.060
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: The repair and maintenance requirement of our ships is already at the, you know,

asr-007266
04:49:37.400 --> 04:49:39.220
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: delikado na po.

asr-007267
04:49:39.660 --> 04:49:41.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Baka din na namin masustain.

asr-007268
04:49:41.200 --> 04:49:48.380
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, we are really appealing to the Senate to consider our budgetary request.

asr-007269
04:49:49.980 --> 04:49:55.440
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We have to remember, Your Honor, that we only have so much ships.

asr-007270
04:49:56.400 --> 04:49:57.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And operating...

asr-007271
04:49:57.520 --> 04:50:00.600
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: at almost 80-90% operational tempo.

asr-007272
04:50:01.540 --> 04:50:05.780
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, the time between overhaul is very, very short.

asr-007273
04:50:06.880 --> 04:50:09.860
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It's just a matter of time that we will run out of ships.

asr-007274
04:50:11.020 --> 04:50:12.880
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We are trying to prevent that.

asr-007275
04:50:12.980 --> 04:50:16.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Do we have any vessel expected to be coming?

asr-007276
04:50:16.200 --> 04:50:21.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I think yung mga binring up ni Senator Zubiri,

asr-007277
04:50:21.400 --> 04:50:25.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: President Zubiri before, yung naglagay tayo ng 2.5 billion na hindi na tuloy.

asr-007278
04:50:26.440 --> 04:50:27.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, what are the updates?

asr-007279
04:50:27.520 --> 04:50:29.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What's the status of these vessels?

asr-007280
04:50:30.500 --> 04:50:37.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yun pong 2.5 billion na hindi po natuloy yung nung 2024-25.

asr-007281
04:50:39.180 --> 04:50:40.180
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Nagpapasalamat po kami.

asr-007282
04:50:40.280 --> 04:50:41.500
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Pinunduhan niyo po kami uli.

asr-007283
04:50:42.300 --> 04:50:50.580
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, we are now pursuing the procurement process for the local construction of 160-meter vessel.

asr-007284
04:50:51.500 --> 04:50:53.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: But on top of that, we are...

asr-007285
04:50:53.900 --> 04:50:56.960
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We are to receive 5 more...

asr-007286
04:50:56.960 --> 04:50:57.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: 97...

asr-007287
04:50:57.520 --> 04:50:58.840
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: 7 meters from Japan.

asr-007288
04:51:00.420 --> 04:51:06.140
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And 40-35 meter fast patrol crafts from France.

asr-007289
04:51:06.900 --> 04:51:12.520
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: But this will happen at the soonest next year, yung maliliit.

asr-007290
04:51:13.300 --> 04:51:16.180
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And yung malalaki will be 2029.

asr-007291
04:51:17.520 --> 04:51:21.500
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, sa ngayon po, Your Honor, we have to make good with what we have.

asr-007292
04:51:22.100 --> 04:51:25.140
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: That's why we really need very, very badly

asr-007293
04:51:25.140 --> 04:51:27.400
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: the repair and maintenance.

asr-007294
04:51:27.520 --> 04:51:27.980
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Funding.

asr-007295
04:51:30.400 --> 04:51:30.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya nga.

asr-007296
04:51:30.800 --> 04:51:35.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, itong drop in sea-based patrol funding under the Maritime Security Law Enforcement Program,

asr-007297
04:51:35.680 --> 04:51:39.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it will really impact yung PCG's daily operational response, no?

asr-007298
04:51:40.100 --> 04:51:41.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-007299
04:51:41.400 --> 04:51:42.020
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Assaults.

asr-007300
04:51:42.600 --> 04:51:44.340
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It's the minimum that we need.

asr-007301
04:51:44.540 --> 04:51:48.020
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So, kung babawasan pa po, we will be constrained.

asr-007302
04:51:48.160 --> 04:51:50.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It was cut down by 812 million.

asr-007303
04:51:52.000 --> 04:51:56.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano po yung bare minimum para naman at least yung presence sa atin ay nandun,

asr-007304
04:51:56.460 --> 04:51:57.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hindi ma-hamper yung...

asr-007305
04:51:57.520 --> 04:52:00.340
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: I can't give you the numbers now, Your Honor, but we can give it back to you.

asr-007306
04:52:00.340 --> 04:52:02.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, please submit yung talagang ano.

asr-007307
04:52:02.620 --> 04:52:02.900
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-007308
04:52:02.900 --> 04:52:03.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Again, bare minimum.

asr-007309
04:52:04.160 --> 04:52:04.600
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-007310
04:52:04.620 --> 04:52:07.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pasensya na, talagang masikip ang ating space ngayon,

asr-007311
04:52:07.120 --> 04:52:10.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kaya lahat ang hinihingi ko sa lahat ng agencies now is bare minimum.

asr-007312
04:52:11.220 --> 04:52:11.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-007313
04:52:11.520 --> 04:52:12.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just to survive.

asr-007314
04:52:13.100 --> 04:52:16.060
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: If I may, Your Honor, take advantage of this opportunity.

asr-007315
04:52:16.980 --> 04:52:19.640
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We also submitted a supplemental request.

asr-007316
04:52:21.020 --> 04:52:25.500
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And we listed there the key activities that we must undertake.

asr-007317
04:52:25.500 --> 04:52:25.600
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Okay.

asr-007318
04:52:26.280 --> 04:52:27.500
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Number one is the...

asr-007319
04:52:27.520 --> 04:52:29.980
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Continuation of our personal procurement program,

asr-007320
04:52:30.640 --> 04:52:34.820
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: which is in our table of organization and equipage.

asr-007321
04:52:35.360 --> 04:52:39.020
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Because if we fail in undertaking that activity,

asr-007322
04:52:39.920 --> 04:52:43.940
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: the pyramid structure of our organization will be compromised.

asr-007323
04:52:43.940 --> 04:52:50.120
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And it will result in incongruence in the promotion of our people,

asr-007324
04:52:50.420 --> 04:52:52.060
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: and that can affect retention.

asr-007325
04:52:52.560 --> 04:52:53.560
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It can affect morale.

asr-007326
04:52:54.140 --> 04:52:56.780
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: The last thing that we need if we are to keep the Coast Guard,

asr-007327
04:52:57.520 --> 04:53:02.280
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: that disciplined and in high morale to secure the West Philippine Sea.

asr-007328
04:53:03.040 --> 04:53:08.880
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Second is we also forwarded to this body a request

asr-007329
04:53:08.880 --> 04:53:14.700
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: to undertake at least our own approach in the acquisition of helicopters.

asr-007330
04:53:16.000 --> 04:53:18.480
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Your Honor, we only have one helicopter flying now,

asr-007331
04:53:18.600 --> 04:53:20.100
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: the one that we are using in Coron.

asr-007332
04:53:20.880 --> 04:53:24.100
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: The other one needs major repair.

asr-007333
04:53:25.520 --> 04:53:26.800
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And number three,

asr-007334
04:53:27.520 --> 04:53:33.760
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: to leverage automated systems, unmanned systems,

asr-007335
04:53:34.520 --> 04:53:37.120
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: artificial intelligence in the way we do things.

asr-007336
04:53:37.120 --> 04:53:42.320
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So we have also placed there unmanned tactical capabilities.

asr-007337
04:53:43.040 --> 04:53:48.760
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We'd like to have this innovation in the way we do things

asr-007338
04:53:48.760 --> 04:53:51.120
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: because we wish to be somehow...

asr-007339
04:53:53.040 --> 04:53:55.440
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: to remain within the curve,

asr-007340
04:53:56.040 --> 04:53:57.320
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: to remain within the race.

asr-007341
04:53:57.520 --> 04:54:00.600
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: With AI now being employed by our adversaries.

asr-007342
04:54:01.400 --> 04:54:04.160
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We just can't remain in the conventional way

asr-007343
04:54:04.160 --> 04:54:07.340
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: if we are to keep this country safe.

asr-007344
04:54:09.000 --> 04:54:10.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So for the record,

asr-007345
04:54:10.720 --> 04:54:17.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the Coast Guard only has one operating air asset or chopper.

asr-007346
04:54:17.680 --> 04:54:18.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Chopper.

asr-007347
04:54:18.640 --> 04:54:19.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As you mentioned.

asr-007348
04:54:20.560 --> 04:54:21.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How many choppers do we have?

asr-007349
04:54:21.580 --> 04:54:21.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just two?

asr-007350
04:54:22.120 --> 04:54:22.500
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Just two.

asr-007351
04:54:22.720 --> 04:54:24.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So we are 50%.

asr-007352
04:54:24.200 --> 04:54:26.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Where do you want to go?

asr-007353
04:54:27.520 --> 04:54:28.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nasa Palawan area dito.

asr-007354
04:54:29.440 --> 04:54:29.820
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, sir.

asr-007355
04:54:29.860 --> 04:54:33.220
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We dispatch it there when we have this recent incident.

asr-007356
04:54:36.600 --> 04:54:41.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So your proposal is to acquire additional air asset

asr-007357
04:54:41.540 --> 04:54:43.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or to repair the other one?

asr-007358
04:54:43.520 --> 04:54:45.680
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yung repair po, may funding na po tayo

asr-007359
04:54:45.680 --> 04:54:47.380
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: nasa procurement.

asr-007360
04:54:47.980 --> 04:54:48.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Air bus yan eh, no?

asr-007361
04:54:49.160 --> 04:54:49.640
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, sir.

asr-007362
04:54:49.800 --> 04:54:50.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero yung...

asr-007363
04:54:50.120 --> 04:54:51.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kamahal ng air bus kasi.

asr-007364
04:54:51.560 --> 04:54:51.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Opo.

asr-007365
04:54:51.860 --> 04:54:56.680
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: But we are availing of this innovative way

asr-007366
04:54:56.680 --> 04:54:59.200
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: of acquiring new assets.

asr-007367
04:54:59.460 --> 04:55:00.560
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It is a lease to own.

asr-007368
04:55:01.380 --> 04:55:06.720
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: And with a performance-based logistics system attached to it,

asr-007369
04:55:06.720 --> 04:55:11.780
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: we will be assured of around 80% availability of aircraft.

asr-007370
04:55:12.580 --> 04:55:17.020
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So it is a system now being pursued by other modern armed forces.

asr-007371
04:55:18.720 --> 04:55:22.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You are already pursuing this para madagdagan niya ating air asset?

asr-007372
04:55:22.480 --> 04:55:23.400
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-007373
04:55:23.840 --> 04:55:26.300
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: At saka mas mabilis po yung delivery, Your Honor.

asr-007374
04:55:26.680 --> 04:55:28.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Also, meron kayong cut.

asr-007375
04:55:31.460 --> 04:55:36.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: There's a 600 million reduction in the unmanned tactical capability project?

asr-007376
04:55:37.040 --> 04:55:38.900
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, it's the...

asr-007377
04:55:38.900 --> 04:55:39.980
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We requested for that.

asr-007378
04:55:40.120 --> 04:55:41.300
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Dito pong binanggit ko po.

asr-007379
04:55:41.960 --> 04:55:44.100
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Hindi po siya na-consider sa NEP namin.

asr-007380
04:55:44.300 --> 04:55:45.560
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: So we'd like to appeal.

asr-007381
04:55:45.740 --> 04:55:46.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano tayo? Ito yung mga drones?

asr-007382
04:55:47.380 --> 04:55:50.320
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, air, surface, and undersea.

asr-007383
04:55:50.400 --> 04:55:50.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Undersea.

asr-007384
04:55:50.900 --> 04:55:50.940
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Undersea.

asr-007385
04:55:53.660 --> 04:55:55.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With regards to intelligence fund,

asr-007386
04:55:55.520 --> 04:55:56.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: PCG's intelligence fund,

asr-007387
04:55:56.680 --> 04:56:00.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: was reduced by 150 million for the current year

asr-007388
04:56:00.500 --> 04:56:05.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with only 400 million for 2027.

asr-007389
04:56:05.640 --> 04:56:07.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is this enough for PCG?

asr-007390
04:56:07.420 --> 04:56:10.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What are the plans to optimize the amount?

asr-007391
04:56:11.920 --> 04:56:14.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We can discuss it in February.

asr-007392
04:56:16.200 --> 04:56:19.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Then the establishment of the Philippine Coast Guard Headquarters

asr-007393
04:56:19.360 --> 04:56:24.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is allocated with 1.7 billion for 2020

asr-007394
04:56:24.620 --> 04:56:26.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: out of 5 billion total cost.

asr-007395
04:56:26.680 --> 04:56:30.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Can you provide us with the timeline for completion?

asr-007396
04:56:30.440 --> 04:56:32.780
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: It will be completed in three years, Your Honor.

asr-007397
04:56:35.860 --> 04:56:37.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ongoing? It's ongoing?

asr-007398
04:56:37.280 --> 04:56:38.900
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: We will be doing our groundbreaking.

asr-007399
04:56:38.920 --> 04:56:39.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our groundbreaking pala?

asr-007400
04:56:39.940 --> 04:56:41.100
PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Gavan: Yes, this month.

asr-007401
