05:15:00.000 --> 05:15:17.280
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: Just to give further updates on the Bukidnon Airport as mentioned by the good secretary, matatapos po yung some ancillary facilities including the passenger terminal building this December. Ang operations po nasabi rin po next year po either first or second quarter for the jet operations.

asr-007925
05:15:17.280 --> 05:15:39.180
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: May inayos lang po yung box culvert na nakita po namin sa ilalim ng pang-connect ng 1,600 papunta sa 2,100 meters. Nagkaroon na po ng budget at na-approve na po ng CAAP board at ng aming director general, General Raul, 150 million additional budget from the CAAP corporate operating budget po.

asr-007926
05:15:39.180 --> 05:15:47.180
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: So yun po yung ginagawa. Yung vehicular parking area malapit na rin po matapos. Nakikipag-ugnayan na rin po ang...

asr-007927
05:15:47.280 --> 05:16:05.060
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: Kaap and DOTR sa DPWH para doon sa access road na kailangan para makapasok doon sa passenger terminal building. And as mentioned by the secretary, we're very positive po na makukomplete namin within the timeline that was committed by the Department of Transportation and CAAP. Thank you po, Senator. Thank you, Sec.

asr-007928
05:16:06.040 --> 05:16:08.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So target next year, operations?

asr-007929
05:16:09.220 --> 05:16:11.060
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: Yes, yes, Senator. Mr. Chair.

asr-007930
05:16:11.420 --> 05:16:16.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos na ba yung runway? Finish na except for the culvert? Yung ginagawa niyong culvert?

asr-007931
05:16:16.540 --> 05:16:31.520
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: Nagawa na po yung kabuhuhan ng 2,100 pero yun po sa taas ng culvert hindi pa po nakukongkrituhan kasi kailangan po ma-retrofit yung sa culvert sa ilalim. Nagawa na rin po yung culvert but we want to make sure kasi po dinadaanan ng tubig.

asr-007932
05:16:31.520 --> 05:16:44.240
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: And kapag nagkaroon na po ng operations, magiging mabigat po yung load na para doon sa runway and we're also expecting because magkakaroon ng community around, meron pong mga environmental impact na kailangan naming siguraduhin.

asr-007933
05:16:44.240 --> 05:16:45.600
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: So we made it.

asr-007934
05:16:46.540 --> 05:16:57.940
CAAP Deputy Director General for Administration Atty. Danjun G. Lucas: Seemed it prudent as approved by the Secretary and the Director General na i-retrofit pa po para sigurado po tayo kasi running water po yung nandun sa ilalim. So we don't want to risk it, Mr. Chair. So salamat po.

asr-007935
05:17:01.620 --> 05:17:16.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you. Yan yung mga ano eh. Hopefully, pag natapos yung bukid nun, sana kung masimula din na yung mati, that will be good addition especially for Mindanao. Meron isa sa southern part and then eastern side.

asr-007936
05:17:16.540 --> 05:17:18.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So that will be a good addition.

asr-007937
05:17:19.260 --> 05:17:19.920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po.

asr-007938
05:17:19.920 --> 05:17:22.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We'll do, Mr. Chair.

asr-007939
05:17:22.080 --> 05:17:28.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo yung mati, sayang din yun eh. We would want to help, support lalo na yung Caraga area.

asr-007940
05:17:31.080 --> 05:17:43.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron din magkapatulong. Of course, yung sa Kamigin, probably submit us any updates sa Kamigin Airport. Siya ba pwede mag-satisfy? Kasi tinanong din niya, kukurisim area din.

asr-007941
05:17:44.660 --> 05:17:46.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po. Yung Kamigin Airport.

asr-007942
05:17:46.540 --> 05:18:05.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The same problem po. Maiksi ang runway. At right-of-way budget po para madagdagan natin, mapahaba natin ang runway. Ilang beses na po kami bumalik po dun. At ito po yung mga pagkakatuon din para ma-inspect natin mapantalan kasama ang PPA.

asr-007943
05:18:05.200 --> 05:18:16.300
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At nakapagtabi po kami ng meron pong budget na yun. I think in the amount of 250 million, if I'm not mistaken. But visaro po siya.

asr-007944
05:18:16.540 --> 05:18:44.280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: 150 million. At iniingi po namin yan. Tapos meron na rin po kaming right-of-way na paunang budget na naibigay na rin namin. Download namin sa Kamigin po para masimula na rin po yung pagkukuha ng mga lote na kinakailangan. We need more budget, sir. At least yung unahin talaga namin yung runway. Para, again, mga jet po yung pwede na lumapag sa ating Kamigin.

asr-007945
05:18:44.280 --> 05:18:46.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At mas mababa po.

asr-007946
05:18:46.540 --> 05:18:47.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pagmasahe kung gano'n.

asr-007947
05:18:49.460 --> 05:18:57.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And also, Kamigin, again, Mindanao din yan. That's a very big potential for tourism. Sayang din yun.

asr-007948
05:19:00.280 --> 05:19:14.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With Marina, I'll just like to ask Marina. Miss Sonia Malaluan, ating administrator. Meron ba kayong plano na i-modernize yung sea service record ng Sea Man's Record Book?

asr-007949
05:19:15.160 --> 05:19:16.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi nyo pa ba?

asr-007950
05:19:16.540 --> 05:19:23.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Gagawing digitally verifiable, no? Para ang inyong immigration records kaysa physical passport, wet stamp.

asr-007951
05:19:24.340 --> 05:19:35.100
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair, and with the permission of the Secretary. Sa ngayon po, may plano po. Kaya lang wala pa po talagang provision ng budget.

asr-007952
05:19:35.100 --> 05:19:55.300
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Because ang pinaprioritize po namin, which we included in our budget proposal, is the tech refresh and the data center as well as the recovery system for the seafarer identity document and seafarer's record book issue 1 system.

asr-007953
05:19:55.300 --> 05:20:03.020
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: But nakasama po yan sa medium term plan to have an electronic record book.

asr-007954
05:20:03.020 --> 05:20:04.900
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Sa ngayon po, verifiable.

asr-007955
05:20:05.100 --> 05:20:24.620
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: In terms of the validity of the record book as well as yung biometric features na nakarecord sa SID, included doon yung chip to have the biometric, facial biometric features.

asr-007956
05:20:24.620 --> 05:20:29.880
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So kasama naman po as long as mag-provide po ng additional budget.

asr-007957
05:20:30.260 --> 05:20:33.840
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Although hindi pa po namin naisama sa proposal ng 27.

asr-007958
05:20:33.840 --> 05:20:49.800
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Because inuuna nga po namin na ma-refresh software and hardware of the SID-SRB system that started, which started its implementation in 2019.

asr-007959
05:20:50.600 --> 05:21:00.660
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So develop po ito in 2018. So almost 8 years po. Walang update. Walang any revision since then up to now.

asr-007960
05:21:00.660 --> 05:21:03.800
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Both in software and in hardware po.

asr-007961
05:21:03.840 --> 05:21:16.640
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So we expect, actually we're experiencing frequent breakdown of the hardware because of that we need to replace na po the hardware and have an update on the software.

asr-007962
05:21:17.280 --> 05:21:26.780
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So next po yung plan to have the electronic seafarer's record book together with the electronic training record book.

asr-007963
05:21:27.080 --> 05:21:28.460
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: So mayroon naman pong plano.

asr-007964
05:21:31.120 --> 05:21:31.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-007965
