asr-008002
05:24:03.420 --> 05:24:08.480
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: And hopefully, we will be able to turn it over to the provincial government po.

asr-008003
05:24:08.540 --> 05:24:12.860
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yung operation for an initial three years po by October po, Chair.

asr-008004
05:24:14.300 --> 05:24:15.200
